# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Build output — generated by `npm run build`, never committed
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# The face-api weights in models/ ARE tracked deliberately: they are a local
# development convenience for the `module`/`custom` face providers and for
# offline work. They are excluded from the npm tarball by .npmignore, so they
# never reach consumers. See the "Face detection setup" section in README.md.

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Env files. `.env.example` documents every variable the scripts read and IS
# committed — the negation below keeps it tracked even if the patterns above are
# ever broadened to `.env*`.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

# Agent working state (local memory, scratch output). Not part of the package.
.workbuddy-ai/
outputs/
